#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:239
#: eafad7b4ab72491bb72ca877d098b9e9
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:241
#: ebfafffef08540729acbf348a7865d05
msgid "The RCIN pin is mapped to a timer input instead of the UART, and can be used for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this manner, can provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:243
#: 1fb40c23db6d46e986885e428cb9bc0f
msgid "To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 receivers, a full UART must be used. For example, UART1 can have its protocol changed from the default GPS protocol for GPS2 to RX input protocol:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:245
#: 0c44bb9da66a47fb96d0fbd8cff28511
msgid "With this option, SERIAL4_PROTOCOL must be set to “23”, and:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:247
#: bdfaee915eb24159b04381011e874e3a
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:249
#: 95adaa9d7c514dc597c76e0723e69db1
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX1 pin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:251
#: 560146c085e54e5094b7cb32b8d47b8b
msgid "FPort requires connection to TX1 and RX1. See FPort Receivers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:253
#: d87feeff2f0b440dbd627d944a1f8056
msgid "CRSF also requires a TX1 connection, in addition to RX1, and automatically provides telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:255
#: ea1485424e614b3b8ab5fbb24c85b3f8
msgid "SRXL2 requires a connection to TX1 and automatically provides telemetry. Set SERIAL4_OPTIONS to “4”."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:257
#: 4428cac5bc714265a3bed7e5ade8cd4d
msgid "Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is compatible with all protocols except PPM. See Radio Control Systems for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:260
#: 5b66d776e1474155997778bccb0972b0
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:262
#: af064369b3204615b9f91ca9c8d5ac76
msgid "The A6SE supports up to 11 PWM outputs,support all PWM protocols as well as DShot. All 11 PWM outputs have GND on the bottom row, 5V on the middle row and signal on the top row."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:264
#: 2e2b01afa9f74c5b9183fbeeed1a5a82
msgid "The 11 PWM outputs are in 3 groups:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:266
#: ff867934ed454012a61a4a9f798daf87
msgid "PWM 1, 2, 3 and 4 in group1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:267
#: 99b2667e3f3848a993fe72e646bfd8ee
msgid "PWM 5, 6, 7 and 8 in group2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:268
#: 404be777f20842d3ab577d3a6a8a33cf
msgid "PWM 9, 10, 11 in group3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:270
#: ad0baf4850aa44a3b999c8732e50c8bc
msgid "Channels 1-8 support bi-directional Dshot. Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any channel in a group uses DShot, then all channels in that group need to use DShot."
msgstr ""

